abstract: "Transcriptions of the examination books HCA 13/20 to HCA 13/79 (depositions, 1570 to 1685) and a raw machine transcription of the personal-answer book HCA 13/125 (1652 to 1654), from records held by The National Archives, Kew. MarineLives is a volunteer collaboration launched in 2012."
